node_modules/
data/
out/*
# …except the evidence corpus, which is the audit's own proof.
#
# It was excluded when it was 152 MB. It is 5.6 MB now — 2.4 MB of documents,
# 3.1 MB of manifest, 0.2 MB describing the bodies that were not documents —
# because 98.4% of the old size was block-explorer HTML served where a
# feedbackURI pointed at an address page instead of a file, and those are now
# recorded rather than stored whole. A verdict whose proof lives only on an
# ephemeral container is the thing this repository objects to.
!out/evidence-corpus/
!out/evidence-corpus/**
dist/
.env
*.log
data-bs/
out-*/
